ba and percussion, had always existed side by side.\n            \n                    \n    \n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tBuy your ticketsBook your tickets here\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tOn stage\nKiya Tabassian, setar & voice\nAblaye Cissoko, kora & voice\nPatrick Graham, percussion\nPierre-Yves Martel, viola da gamba\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\tTime6 June 2026 15 h 00 min(GMT+09:00)\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tLocationAOI Concert Hall ShizuokaJapon, 〒420-0851 Shizuoka, Aoi Ward, Kuroganecho, 1−9 静岡中央郵便局うえ7～9階Other Events\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tWhereShizuoka, Japan\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\tOrganizerAOI Concert Hall ShizuokaLearn More\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLearn More\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tCalendarGoogleCal\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\tGet Directions\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tAddress - Traversées []\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tDestination Address - Traversées []\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\tItami Aiphonic Hall1 Chome-3-30 Miyanomae, Itami, Hyogo 664-0895, Japon\n\t\t\t\t    \t{\"@context\": \"http://schema.org\",\"@type\": \"Event\",\n\t\t\t\t\"@id\": \"event_19403_0\",\n\t\t\t\t\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\n\t\t\t\t\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\n\t\t\t\t\"name\": \"Traversées\",\n\t\t\t\t\"url\": \"https://constantinople.ca/en/events/traversees-188/var/ri-0.l-L2\",\n\t\t\t\t\"startDate\": \"2026-6-7T14:00-4:00\",\n\t\t\t\t\"endDate\": \"2026-6-7T23:59-4:00\",\n\t\t\t\t\"image\":\"https://constantinople.ca/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/traversees.jpg\", \n\t\t\t\t\"description\":\"<p>This meeting and dialogue between the kora and the setar seemed to come from the depths of the earth, as though these instruments, along with the viola da 