  {
    "@id": "https://constantinople.ca/en/events/duende-hal-7/event_18914_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://constantinople.ca/en/events/duende-hal-7/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://constantinople.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/dani-de-moron_131-1.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://constantinople.ca/en/events/duende-hal-7/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "DUENDE &amp; HÂL"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>DUENDE &amp; HÂL</p> <p>Flamenco Impulses</p> <p>The sense of wonder and inspiration known as the <em>duende</em> in flamenco and the <em>hâl</em> in Persian music reaches its peak here. Kiya Tabassian, musical explorer and master of the Persian setar, enters into a passionate and fascinating musical dialogue with flamenco guitar ambassador Dani de Morón. Together, they craft a musical fresco rich in color and resonance.</p> <p>Two virtuosos, surrounded by outstanding percussionists, elevate and create new music inspired by their flamenco and Persian roots. Between modality and colorful harmonies, captivating rhythms, and an overflowing synergy, the three masters take the audience on a journey full of discoveries.</p> "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/startDate": [
      {
        "@type": "http://schema.org/Date",
        "@value": "2025-10-11T20:15-4::00"
      }
