        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Bach-Khayyam - Constantinople"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Bach-Khayyam"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "For this new creation Constantinople proposes arrangements of some of the most beautiful spiritual songs and arias of JS Bach in dialogue with poems of Omar Khayyam sung in Persian and responding to Bach’s songs.     "
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Even if more than 600 years separates the life of John-Sebastien Bach (1685 -1715) and Omar Khayam"
      }
    ],
