        "@value": "Clair-obscur - Constantinople"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Between sea and mountains, between modes and polyphony — Clair-obscur is born of the desire for deeper dialogue on the part both of the musicians of Constantinople and the singers of A Filetta, the preeminent ensemble of Corsican polyphony."
      }
    ],
